### author at 2026-11-17T10:03:10Z

Rewrote it in @REWORD_SHA@ to say what goes wrong: a balance in the tab's own currency is not converted, but it can still hold a fraction of a cent, and that request went out unrounded and the bank rejected it. That is why it is rounded here too.
